<title>NEW ZEALAND: Commerce Commission clears NZCDC to buy Bay Milk.</title>
<headline>Commerce Commission clears NZCDC to buy Bay Milk.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The anti-monopolies Commerce Commission said on Friday it had cleared the New Zealand Co-operative Dairy Company to buy the assets of Bay Milk Products Ltd, saying NZCDC would not acquire or strengthen a dominant position in any market.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
